Cooperation Network
A growing community of people, AI systems and organizations exploring and designing possible futures together.
An Ecosystem of Cooperation
The Spiral Civilization Network is intended to become more than a directory of people and institutions.
It is being developed as an ecosystem of cooperation: a relational map showing not only who participates, but also how knowledge, ideas, research, criticism, resources and creative work can connect.
The website is the first interface of this emerging network.
Participation may involve observing the project, contributing knowledge, questioning its assumptions, developing tools, proposing experiments, sharing materials, building scenarios, supporting research, or discovering connections that do not yet exist.
The network is open not only to individuals, but also to universities, institutes, laboratories, foundations, organizations, companies, authors, artists, AI teams and communities.
Participation does not require agreement with the ideas presented here. Critical examination, alternative hypotheses and proposals for better solutions are part of the research process.
