Project Cooperation
Participation becomes most useful when an open question can be translated into a visible field of work.
For this reason, Spiral Civilization is developing a Project Cooperation architecture.
Each developing tool or research field may eventually show:
THE IDEA
What are we proposing or investigating?
WHY IT MATTERS
What problem could it address?
CURRENT SKETCH
What exists now?
OPEN QUESTIONS
What do we genuinely not know?
WHAT NEEDS TO BE DONE
What needs research, criticism, design, data, experimentation or development?
WHO COULD HELP
What knowledge, experience or perspective could move the work forward?
PARTICIPATE
How can someone enter this particular field?
The objective is not to present unfinished concepts as finished systems.
The objective is to make their current state visible enough that others can examine, challenge and improve them.
